# CI/CD Rules

## Workflows

- `pr.yml` — runs on pull requests
- `stage.yml` — runs on push to default branch
- `release.yml` — handles releases
- `pages.yml` — deploys MkDocs documentation

## Container Builds

- Multi-platform: amd64, arm/v7, arm64/v8
- Dockerfile should run as non-root user (pending fix)
